7. hakoCap screen-capture engine (Windows desktop application)
================================================================

The Windows build of the desktop application ships the hakoCap screen-capture
engine in resources/hakoCap/: the program hakocap-daemon.exe, and the GStreamer
runtime it loads at run time as separate DLLs in resources/hakoCap/gstreamer/
(bin/, lib/gstreamer-1.0/ and libexec/). The GStreamer runtime is a curated
subset of the unmodified official GStreamer 1.28.4 MSVC x86_64 build (the
plugins hakoCap's packaging script selects, plus the libraries they depend on);
you can replace any of these DLLs with your own build of the same library.

